7	 * postcode falling in a known region's range (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099)
8	 * fixes the region directly, which disambiguates cities that share a name. Only when the
9	 * postcode is absent or in no known range does it fall back to the fixed city-to-region
10	 * table. Kept out of {@link OwnerMapper} so MapStruct does not mistake the helper for an
11	 * implicit mapping method and apply it to every string property.
